# UI Runtime Validation
RULE: Never claim UI works without runtime verification. Start dev server, wait 8-10s, check terminal for errors.
WHY: Incident: claimed "npm run dev works" without checking; user found CSS/import errors.
CODEX: .cursor/rules/runtime-verification-required.mdc, .cursor/rules/ui-runtime-validation.mdc
DO: npm run dev; wait 8-10s; grep terminal for error/failed/exception; verify ready message
NEVER: Claim "done" without running; skip terminal output check; assume success from first line
